0..25 Comment "//! The phase distinction"
26..114 Comment "//! [Sterling-2021-logical_relations_types_proofrelevant_parametricity_program_modules]:"
115..195 Comment "//! a module\'s type members are its static part and its values its dynamic part,"
196..273 Comment "//! ordered static below dynamic. A member reads only members at or below its"
274..353 Comment "//! own phase, so a type reads types and static data, and a value reads both. A"
354..433 Comment "//! type member reading a module\'s or a parameter\'s value is refused by name at"
434..488 Comment "//! the value (`PhaseDependence`), stated beside it in"
489..534 Comment "//! `../../pathological/modules/phase.gandr`."
535..538 Comment "//!"
539..635 Comment "//! - cites: [Sterling-2021-logical_relations_types_proofrelevant_parametricity_program_modules]"
